-- id: exp6874-v602-evidence-substrate-manifest-contract
-  title: V602 evidence, substrate, and executable-manifest contract
-  track: infrastructure
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: codex
-  model: gpt-5.6-sol
-  requires_gpu: false
-  max_turns: 30
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 180
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.602
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6874_v602_evidence_substrate_manifest_contract.json
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    V601 completed nine executable tasks. Exp6869 rejected the calibrated semantic-likelihood
-    rule. Exp6873 found no update gain over read-only memory. Several short deterministic CPU
-    artifacts were conductor-stamped DURATION_TOO_SHORT because their substrate strings were not
-    explicit no-LLM sentinels. The V601 design document also listed four ARC tasks that were absent
-    from the executable YAML and never ran. This task freezes the terminal evidence and the exact
-    11-task V602 contract without rewriting old artifacts.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md and {project_root}/_bmad/prd.md
-    - {project_root}/research-roadmap.yaml and the activation commit receipts for its pre-activation sources
-    - {project_root}/openspec/change-proposals/research-roadmap-vNEXT.md
-    - {project_root}/ops/conductor-log.md, V601 terminal rows
-    - {project_root}/ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml and {project_root}/ops/known-issues.md
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6865_v601_evidence_method_change_contract.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6868_three_family_semantic_scoring_stream_v2.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6869_calibration_only_semantic_rule.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6870_sealed_independent_semantic_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6871_observable_reliability_opportunity_stream.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6872_bounded_reliability_controller_quarantine.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6873_prospective_sealed_self_learning_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/scripts/adversarial_verify.py and {project_root}/scripts/substrate_alias_evidence_lint.py
-
-    TASK:
-    Build an append-only V602 evidence contract. Recompute V601 task coverage, stored and fresh
-    adversarial dispositions, branch closures, and the V601 design/YAML mismatch from primary
-    sources. Validate that the V602 document and activated research-roadmap.yaml contain the same
-    11 task IDs, deliverables, gates, and prior-failure blocks. Use durable git receipts for the
-    pre-activation next-roadmap copy. Do not rerun science or edit any V601 artifact.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require every V601 deliverable, its conductor terminal row, the activated
-       V602 roadmap, durable pre-activation git receipts, the exclusion manifest, and current
-       verifier code. On failure, write
-       complete_blocked_v602_evidence_substrate_manifest_contract with gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-REPORT-6874 and focused tests before implementation. Cover a missing V601 artifact,
-       missing conductor row, wrapped field, stale artifact, document-only task, YAML-only task,
-       gate-field typo, missing prior-failure subfield, and retired dependency.
-    2. Recompute the nine V601 task IDs, deliverables, hashes, honest verdicts, verdict classes,
-       gate results, stored adversarial flags, and fresh adversarial flags. Preserve disagreements.
-    3. For each short CPU artifact, inspect its code, command receipt, model-call count, GPU receipt,
-       and source rows. Mark it eligible only when new LLM inference is mechanically absent. Do not
-       change duration floors or allow arbitrary prose aliases.
-    4. Freeze Exp6869 as a null calibrated semantic result and Exp6870 as its correct gate block.
-       Freeze Exp6873 as no demonstrated update benefit over read-only. Do not reopen either method.
-    5. Prove that Exp6874-Exp6877 in the old V601 design text had no matching task in the active
-       nine-task YAML, no conductor run, and no result artifact. Record them as never executed.
-    6. Parse the activated research-roadmap.yaml and the V602 design document. Use the activation
-       commit diff to prove the staged research-roadmap-next.yaml was copied before deletion. Require
-       identical task order, task count, IDs, deliverables, gate fields, upstream IDs, and experiment
-       range 6874-6884.
-    7. Check every prior_failures entry for experiment_id, exact verdict, addressed_by, and
-       retire_if_same_verdict=true. Check that no gated dependency names a retired task.
-    8. Set v602_evidence_contract_ready_score=1 only when V601 evidence is source-complete and the
-       V602 document/YAML parity and exclusion checks pass.
-    9. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, substrate-alias lint,
-       artifact-convention audit, verdict-row consistency lint, YAML parsing, and root-clutter checks.
-    10. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one principle per required field and every
-       gate field; preconditions_checked; inference_substrate
-       (aggregation_from_upstream_artifacts_no_llm); duration_s; source_artifact_hashes; rows (one
-       V601 or V602 task per row); v601_terminal_task_rows; v601_stored_vs_fresh_adversarial_rows;
-       deterministic_substrate_requalification_rows; fixed_sequence_semantic_branch_closed (true);
-       reliability_update_branch_closed (true); v601_design_yaml_mismatch_rows;
-       v601_unexecuted_design_task_rows; v602_document_yaml_parity_rows;
-       v602_activation_copy_receipt; v602_gate_contract_rows; prior_failure_contract_rows;
-       retired_dependency_rows; random_seed; reproducibility_checksum;
-       v602_evidence_contract_ready_score (exact field consumed by Exp6875 and Exp6881);
-       gate_check_summary with failed check, expected value, and observed value for any blocked
-       verdict; verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive | circular_positive | null |
-       blocked | disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal and prefixed complete_).
-
