-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6876 preserves raw three-family relation outputs without opening exact sidecars. This task is
-    the one held opening. It recomputes span grounding, tuple identity, ASP compilation, exact
-    validity, omissions, contradictions, and abstentions. It must preserve model and family nulls.
-    Because the exact checker is evaluation authority, a passing result is circular_positive.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    MODEL_SPECS:
-    - unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF (flagship MoE; frozen rows only)
-    - unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF (flagship dense; frozen rows only)
-    - unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF (middle MoE; frozen rows only)
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_5909_sota_constraint_synthesis_ab.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_5923_sota_schema_supported_constraintir_ab.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6274_asp_energy_semantic_compiler.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6875_text_anchored_relation_asp_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6876_three_family_relational_fact_corpus.json
-    - {project_root}/scripts/adversarial_verify.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/constraint-verification/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    In a fresh process, open the sealed held sidecar once and independently score every frozen raw
-    row. Recompute all headlines from per-unit rows. Decide whether source-anchored relational facts
-    are exact enough to supply a chronological learning stream. Do not generate or repair outputs.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require both Exp6876 readiness fields=1, frozen raw-output hashes, exact
-       model-family counts, one unopened held-sidecar hash, and independent solver availability. On
-       failure, write complete_blocked_independent_relational_fact_qualification with
-       gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-CONSTRAINT-6877 and tests first. Cover held double-open, raw-row mutation, source-span
-       drift, tuple collision, unsupported predicate, omission, contradiction, abstention, model
-       substitution, solver disagreement, aggregate-row contradiction, and missing empty cells.
-    2. Hash the independent reducer and open the held sidecar exactly once. Prove no producer code
-       or calibration statistic selects held labels, predicates, or thresholds.
-    3. Reparse every raw output. Validate character spans against exact source text before tuple
-       normalization. Preserve invalid, duplicate, unsupported, omitted, and abstain rows.
